CM ============================================================
CM TRAP VERTICAL: 40M / 20M / 10M
CM Parallel resonant traps, vertical polarization
CM Quarter-wave vertical with radial ground system
CM NEC-2 / EZNEC compatible
CM
CM Architecture (feed at base, vertical element):
CM   Base feed (Z=0)
CM   -> [10M trap at 2.64m AGL]
CM   -> [20M trap at 5.26m AGL]
CM   -> tip at 10.05m AGL
CM
CM Ground: 32-radial system, 10m long, on ground surface (Z=0)
CM         Real earth, medium ground (ep=13, sig=0.005)
CM
CM ELEMENT DIMENSIONS:
CM   10M: 0 to 2.64m (inner element, resonant at 28.5 MHz)
CM   20M: 0 to 5.26m (resonant at 14.175 MHz with traps)
CM   40M: 0 to 10.05m (resonant at 7.15 MHz with traps)
CM
CM BASE IMPEDANCE (typical with good radial system):
CM   10M: ~25 ohm (use 1:1 choke balun + matching network or half-wave feed)
CM   20M: ~30-50 ohm
CM   40M: ~35-50 ohm
CM
CM Matching: L-network or 1/4-wave matching section recommended.
CM ============================================================
CE

