CM ============================================================
CM VERTICAL PERFORMANCE NOTES:
CM
CM 10M: Gain ~0.5 dBi (typical QW vertical over real ground)
CM 20M: Gain ~1.0 dBi
CM 40M: Gain ~0.8 dBi
CM
CM Feed impedance vs free-space (0 radials = infinite ground plane):
CM   32 radials, 10m: approximately 2-4 dB improvement over no radials
CM   On-ground radials are less efficient than elevated but adequate
CM
CM MATCHING RECOMMENDATIONS:
CM   For 10M: If Zin ~25 ohm, use 3/8-lambda matching stub or L-net
CM   For all bands: wound choke balun (10-turn RG-58 on FT-240-31 core)
CM     prevents common-mode current on feedline
CM
CM TRAP PHYSICAL PLACEMENT:
CM   Traps are NOT at the physical element length shown above.
CM   The trap bodies extend ~100-200mm along the element.
CM   Account for trap body length in overall antenna height.
CM   Physical tip = mathematical tip - trap_body_length_sum
CM ============================================================
